The adapted files re-implement Palace algorithms and structure in JavaScript; no Palace source text is copied. Each
adapted file states in its header the Palace files it follows and what was changed. These files are distributed as
part of the engine under GPL-3.0-or-later (engine/LICENSE); the Apache-2.0 terms continue to apply to the portions
derived from Palace.

Adapted files:
- krylov.mjs  <- palace/linalg/iterative.cpp (GMRES)
- pmg.mjs     <- palace/linalg/gmg.cpp, palace/linalg/distrelaxation.cpp, palace/models/spaceoperator.cpp
                 (p-multigrid V-cycle, Hiptmair distributive relaxation, preconditioner from the complex system)
- lumped.mjs  <- palace/models/lumpedportoperator.cpp, palace/fem/lumpedelement.hpp (lumped ports)
- prom.mjs    <- palace/drivers/drivensolver.cpp, palace/models/romoperator.cpp (adaptive sweep, PROM, MRI)
- ams.mjs     <- palace/linalg/ams.cpp (AMS structure; not wired into the solver yet)
